Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Princess Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-Fifth Episode\NThe King's Ghost
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.02,0:01:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Before telling you\Nthe story of today,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.46,0:01:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,we will briefly remind you of\Nthe previous episodes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.82,0:02:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The King disappeared\Nand it was decided that Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.46,0:02:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...would be crowned King.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.58,0:02:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But on the day of the ceremony,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.34,0:02:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,the Queen,\Ndrugged by Duralumin and Nylon,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.14,0:02:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,revealed that Sapphire was a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.30,0:02:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So the Queen and Sapphire were\Nlocked in the Coffin Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.74,0:02:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Duralumin began\Nto tyrannize the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.62,0:02:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Learning this, Sapphire escaped through a\Nhole shown to her by a little mouse...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.54,0:02:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,...e, in the guise of the phantom\Nknight, freed the prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.94,0:02:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Duralumin, suspecting\Nche il cavaliere fantasma...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.78,0:02:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,...could be Sapphire,\Nsent assassins to the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.74,0:02:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But Sapphire, warned by the little mouse,\Nmanaged to capture them...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.30,0:02:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,.and send them back to Duralumin
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.02,0:02:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,After freeing some children,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.06,0:02:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,taken prisoner\Nto lure him into a trap,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.58,0:02:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, in the guise\Nof the phantom knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.66,0:02:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,manages to enter the castle\Nand steal the royal crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.82,0:02:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Infuriated, Duralumin decides\Nto entrust Gama, the jailer,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.18,0:03:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,with the task of killing\Nthe Queen and Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.34,0:03:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And now Gama prepares himself\Nfor his sad task.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.46,0:03:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Will he succeed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.78,0:03:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.42,0:04:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, dear little mice!\NYou saved my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.74,0:04:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.86,0:04:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, Gama has fainted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.74,0:04:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My God! We must do something
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.10,0:04:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.94,0:04:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But... what the hell did he do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.46,0:04:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Nothing.\N- Nothing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.74,0:05:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean "nothing"?!\NHe wanted to make an attempt on your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.50,0:05:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- He has a knife.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.62,0:05:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sure he was\Nsurprised by the rats...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.54,0:05:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,...and tried to chase them\Naway with the knife, but he fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.34,0:05:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do something,\Notherwise he will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.02,0:05:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he really seems\Nto be doing better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.50,0:05:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's boil a little\Nmore water!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.54,0:05:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.46,0:05:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Try again\Nand this time without an escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.86,0:05:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You must succeed in\Nkilling her absolutely!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.10,0:06:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I will kill those who follow her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- Here you go, mother.\N- Thank you, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.82,0:06:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a scoundrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.86,0:06:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.18,0:06:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Gama, you saved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.34,0:06:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.74,0:06:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Gama, thank you! Thank you!\NThank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.94,0:06:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, Gama!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.62,0:06:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome! You're welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.38,0:07:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.90,0:07:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Gama,\Nmice are cute, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.66,0:07:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's true!\NThey really are very cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.34,0:07:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your\Ndelicious dinner, Gama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.90,0:07:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I must go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.10,0:07:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The Phantom Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.42,0:08:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I will no longer try\Nto tyrannize Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.26,0:08:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true, I have become a staunch\Ndefender of Princess Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.10,0:08:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,..and also of the Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.42,0:08:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Now I understand!\N- That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.06,0:08:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemies of the Phantom Knight\Nare Duralumin and Nylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.54,0:08:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,To defeat Duralumin,\NI will go... even into the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.14,0:08:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But how restless\Nthis girl is!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.06,0:08:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of the castle,\Ndo you know about that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.42,0:08:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- What noise? - Every night,\Na strange noise is heard...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.66,0:08:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,..in the stone well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.46,0:08:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They say it's the ghost of the King\Nwandering around the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.02,0:08:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- My father's ghost?!\N- My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.26,0:08:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but Duralumin\Nhas anyone put in prison..
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.78,0:08:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,...whoever says they have seen\Nthe ghost, or talks about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.34,0:08:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm going to the stone\Nwell, so I'll know something too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.94,0:09:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be the\Nentrance to the stone well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.50,0:09:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The guard seems\Nrather thorough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.70,0:09:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.62,0:09:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.38,0:09:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Close it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.46,0:09:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The ghost knight!\NClose it, quick! Close it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.14,0:09:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but I'm going through anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.10,0:09:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, it's breaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.22,0:10:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!\NWork harder! Work, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.58,0:10:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, push!\NHelp me push!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.26,0:10:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Water! Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.50,0:10:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.74,0:10:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so thirsty!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.86,0:10:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Ghost Knight\Nappeared at the stone well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.62,0:10:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ah, Ghost Knight!\N- Don't joke around!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.66,0:11:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ghost Knight\Ndoesn't really exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.42,0:11:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a children's dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.74,0:11:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If it goes on like this,\Nwe will die of thirst!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.18,0:11:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Water?! No, it's impossible!\NReality is something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.78,0:11:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Then this must\Nsurely be an illusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.62,0:11:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Who poured\Nwater on my face?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.94,0:11:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There's water?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.54,0:11:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Water! Water!\N- Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This really is water!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.58,0:11:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you\Ntake some water?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.82,0:11:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ehi, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.50,0:11:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tyrannize the weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.46,0:11:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is the voice\Nof the Ghost Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.10,0:11:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you? Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.62,0:11:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.02,0:12:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ghost Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.94,0:12:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.74,0:12:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.42,0:12:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.02,0:12:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.10,0:12:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- Please, don't hurt us!\N- All right! Take the chains off everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.70,0:12:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.62,0:12:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Uranaru! Garigori! Balia!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.98,0:13:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But how does he know our names?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.22,0:13:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.66,0:13:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince!... Oh, no! King Sapphire!\NI'm so happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.46,0:13:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,...that you are safe!\N- I have to take care of something
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.18,0:13:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to know about the ghost\Nof my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.02,0:13:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the details,\Nbecause everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.66,0:13:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...who, in some way,\Nhas heard of him...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.94,0:13:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,..has been brought here
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.46,0:13:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone heard his footsteps.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.66,0:13:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- Has no one seen him?\N- No, no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.58,0:13:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It is said that every night,\Nat midnight,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.10,0:13:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the voice\Nand the footsteps of the King...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.42,0:13:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,..are heard coming from the dungeons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.58,0:13:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,From the dungeons?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.10,0:13:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be almost midnight.\NI'm getting the shivers!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.38,0:14:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, it'll start in a bit!\N- Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.02,0:14:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,"The third stone\Nunder the lion decoration".
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.74,0:14:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three...\NThis is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.70,0:14:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is a huge crypt!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.90,0:15:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.10,0:15:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My father's voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.74,0:15:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.74,0:16:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.62,0:16:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- My father!\N- Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.54,0:16:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, you are alive! Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.50,0:16:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But you are Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.74,0:16:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- My father!\N- You're alive too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.70,0:16:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Father, mother is doing well too!\N- Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.90,0:16:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But how did you end up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.26,0:16:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell confined you\Nto this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.94,0:16:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.\NI couldn't see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.74,0:16:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That night,\Nthat is, when I was kidnapped,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.14,0:16:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I was in my room and I was\Nwriting an important proclamation..
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.66,0:17:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,...when they kidnapped me\Nand brought me to these dungeons,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.42,0:17:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,where I was locked up\Nwithout enough food and water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.50,0:17:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy wanted you to\Ndie of hunger. That's it, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.34,0:17:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes. There is something more important.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.50,0:17:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I would really\Nlike us to find...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.74,0:17:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...that proclamation I\Nwas writing that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.94,0:17:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- It was burned, wasn't it?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.50,0:17:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But I wrote it on leather, so\Nit must have remained intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.94,0:17:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, could you find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.66,0:17:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The phantom knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.42,0:18:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What? The phantom knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.50,0:18:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You are still sleeping... The\Nguard is too vigilant and alert...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.54,0:18:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...to allow him\Nto enter. Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.66,0:18:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it is! I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.94,0:18:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It ended up in a strange place
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.14,0:18:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dark to read it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.42,0:18:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey!\N- I'm sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.46,0:18:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Give me the torch!\N- Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.42,0:18:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,"King's Proclamation".\NNow I can read it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.22,0:18:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.30,0:18:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.78,0:19:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.30,0:19:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, look at that...\NRead this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.90,0:19:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This proclamation has been posted\Non all the city walls!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.94,0:19:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,"Today, at ten, everyone gather\Nin front of the castle gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.46,0:19:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- The Phantom Knight".\N- What should we do? Shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.14,0:19:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! Maybe we'll get to see\Nsomething interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.62,0:19:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Drive them away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.26,0:19:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Use arrows, cannons\Nwhatever you want, but drive them away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.86,0:19:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But there are too many of them\Nto drive them away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.14,0:19:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn him! What does he want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.30,0:20:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention!\NI want you all to see a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.70,0:20:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Duralumin! Nylon!\NLook at him closely!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.38,0:20:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's the Queen! How did she escape\Nfrom the coffin tower?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.06,0:20:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The King! It's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.02,0:20:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.22,0:21:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Long live the King!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.90,0:21:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hooray! Hooray!\N- Long live the King!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.14,0:21:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I was confined\Nin the dungeons...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.38,0:21:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...and I was about to be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.22,0:21:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I don't know who\Nthe criminal who wanted to kill me is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.46,0:21:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the phantom knight,\NI was saved and did not die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.62,0:21:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hooray for the phantom knight!\N- Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.34,0:21:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, father, let's go to the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.58,0:21:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not let you enter!\NYou are no longer the King!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.78,0:21:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Now Plastic is the King!\N- Shut up, Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.58,0:21:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This castle belongs to me\Nand to my heir Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.46,0:21:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Heir?!\NNo, she is not the heir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.06,0:21:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,According to our law, a woman\Ncannot succeed to the throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.46,0:21:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This was true\Nuntil I modified the law!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.18,0:21:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Modified the law?!\NCan you show any proof?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.66,0:21:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The proof is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.22,0:21:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the authentic law,\Nbearing the King's seal!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.82,0:22:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Before being imprisoned,\NI wrote and sealed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.34,0:22:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.06,0:22:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I will announce before\Nall the people my proclamation!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.70,0:22:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,"This I declare as King:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.66,0:22:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I modify the original law,\Nwhich established that a woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.70,0:22:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,..could not succeed\Nto the throne of Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.38,0:22:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now a woman can be Queen\Nand rule the country"!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.18,0:22:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.02,0:22:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, dad... so I\Nam no longer King, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.90,0:22:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're not! You bore!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.30,0:22:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But is it really true?\NI'm no longer King?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.46,0:22:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.34,0:22:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Good!\NHow wonderful! Oh, how wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.58,0:22:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And now let's go to the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.06,0:22:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hooray!\N- Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.82,0:22:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Do you think\NI will resign myself and surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.22,0:22:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess! Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.94,0:23:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange that you wear\Nboy's clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.14,0:23:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true. Thank you, maiden
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.30,0:23:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much! But I still want to\Nwear boy's clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.66,0:23:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I will do so until in this country\Nthere are no more tyrants.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.18,0:23:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But I promise you that, when\Npeace finally arrives,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.22,0:23:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,this dress will be\Nthe first one I'll wear!
